{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/bda6532b2fbc6fb53b412a573fcbbe43.avif?t=1753079630\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up your own pond with decorations and bait, then just wait! Weird-looking ugly frogs will show up on their own. Catch them and put them in your bucket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.poster.avif?t=1753079630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.webm?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.mp4?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4398be951fa7841df5a825e59b0b567e.avif?t=1753079630\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 144 super ugly frogs to collect! Each one looks totally different and hilariously weird. Can you catch all these fat, bouncy, round little weirdos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.poster.avif?t=1753079630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.webm?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.mp4?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/e9441931f096179316d11380096a18ad.avif?t=1753079630\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your frogs in tanks, feed them, and take care of them until they get nice and chubby. Then sell them for lots of money! Use the cash to buy cool stuff for your pond and tanks, plus more baby frogs. Where do these frogs go when you sell them? Who knows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.poster.avif?t=1753079630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.webm?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.mp4?t=1753079630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/5893bd6aa0eee8be122d1ff235127af9.avif?t=1753079630\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes huge ugly frogs will attack your pond! Tap the screen like crazy to fight them off! Beat them to get special rewards and unlock rare new frogs. Keep playing to find secret letters that tell you what's really going on with these frog attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.poster.avif?t=1753079630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.